##False case scenarios:-
1) **If no Appointment of Company Secretary/Director (Natural Person) section is found in Main or Continuation sheets, return a table with only the column headers and no data rows.**
2) If no data rows, do not return statements like "I apologize...", just only **return a table with only the column headers and no data rows**\n
